# GitHub + Polaris sync — Megawatt Valley

GitHub (`Mr-Meow-ZA/Megawatt-Valley`) is the shared source of truth for code and living design docs. Polaris is Rapha's durable personal index, not a second design bible.

Polaris vault: `E:\Obsidian Vaults\Polaris_Vault`  
